    "note": "\"search\" is the Agent Client Protocol tool-call kind OpenCode reports (opencode-acp-adapter.ts falls back to update.kind for the tool name) - not a Claude/Codex spelling. Native Android already recognized it as a Grep alias; folded into the shared TS rule to match."
