    "android": false,
    "note": "Shared rule shows the raw tool name for an unrecognized tool. Native Android Title-Cases it (\"Custom provider action\", pre-existing, tested in ThreadPresentationTest.unknownAndMcpToolsDegradeToReadableBoundedSummaries); kept as a documented, intentional divergence rather than a regression."
  },
